<title>USA: Suffolk County, N.Y., sells $250 mln TANs.</title>
<headline>Suffolk County, N.Y., sells $250 mln TANs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers and Bears Stearns &amp; Co said they won portions of a $250 million Suffolk County, N.Y., tax anticipation note (TANs) issue.</p>
<p>Lehman won $175 million of the notes with a 4 percent coupon and a net interest cost (NIC) of 3.2751 percent.</p>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co won $75 million of the notes with a 4 percent coupon and a net interest cost of 3.2557 percent.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
